  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The little wheel with the arrows pointing in different directions that used to show up when one-handed mode was active doesn't show up anymore. It's missing both when opening the Action Menu and when a controller disconnects/loses tracking. I'm using Index controllers and haven't been able to confirm if this occurs on others.\n\nI'm going to assume this is a bug, but in case it isn't, I'd like to see it return. It acted as a helpful indicator of if one-handed mode was active. In this latest beta I find myself not realizing I'm in one-handed mode when a controller disconnects/loses tracking until after I've already attempted to strafe and end up turning or vice versa.",
